+# Workspace compaction policy
+
+App module. Server context owns the only workspaceKey-indexed policy map. Reads return a fresh three-field policy, defaulting only for unsynchronized workspaces. Validated updates affect matching resident sessions only. createRecord reads before initialization and again before publication; updates to another workspace never replace either read. No compaction, history mutation, cancellation or authorization changes. Compatibility exports remain in model-io-preferences. Dependencies: shared and zcode-cli.
