@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# Session auto-compaction limit
+
+Runtime compact config is the only owner. The pure contract applies a requested token/percentage limit without increasing the existing safe threshold. Runtime query resolves the current model without a model request and never mutates config; validated updates affect only the supplied session config. Runtime reconstruction resets the override. Workspace policy updates merge only summary settings and leave the session limit intact. No immediate compaction, authorization changes, new timers, or persistence. Public surfaces: contract.ts and runtime.ts.
